  "body": "Highly functional three-level layout: four bedrooms, four ensuites — beautifully considered living in the heart of Takapuna.\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern family living in mind, this beautifully presented home combines privacy, versatility and effortless convenience in one of the North Shore’s most sought-after locations. With every bedroom enjoying its own ensuite, the layout is ideal for families of all ages and stages.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features a generous master suite with its own ensuite and direct access to the backyard — perfect for grandparents, teenagers, guests or those wanting their own private retreat. A double internal-access garage and additional off-street parking add further practicality.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the first floor offers a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, complete with premium German-made Miele appliances. Large sliding doors open to a private balcony, creating seamless indoor-outdoor flow. A further bedroom with ensuite and a separate guest toilet complete this level.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, two more bedrooms — both with ensuites — sit alongside a second living area, providing a flexible space for relaxing, working from home, or entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally appealing. Takapuna Beach, parks, cafés, restaurants, shops and entertainment are all just moments away, while Auckland CBD is easily accessible by car or public transport.\r\n\r\nThis property falls within zones for Westlake Girls High School and Takapuna Grammar School, with your choice of Takapuna or Belmont Intermediate, and Takapuna or Hauraki Primary School. Families will benefit from outstanding educational options, giving you plenty of choice and confidence for your children’s future.\r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity for families looking to upsize, or those relocating to Takapuna seeking a modern, well-built home with generous space, smart design and a premium location.\r\n\r\nAuction – must be sold.\r\n\r\nView at our open homes, or contact us today to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nConjunctions are welcomed from day one.",
